  "id": "appetitive-behavior",
  "term": "appetitive behavior",
  "definition": "Appetitive behavior is an animal’s searching or approach activity that comes before a more fixed instinctive action pattern. It is the variable early phase of behavior sequences such as seeking food or engaging in courtship before mating.",
